# Closed atoms remain written data. The receiver creates an anonymous value,
# whose complete fields stay visible in the root's AFTER dump.
# наблюдение явной записью: локалы не публикуются (#flush-receiver-contract)
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
)
@: shared data[0]
@: closed (A: B; B: A)
int: seen length(closed\A)
sub: main ()
    shared\Observed\seen := seen
main()
